WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.750
This slide focuses on Avoid leakage Start with the
analytical question and the meaning

00:00:05.763 --> 00:00:11.324
of the output before focusing on the syntax Data
leakage happens when

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:17.208
training uses information that would not be
available at prediction time Split data before

00:00:17.234 --> 00:00:23.824
final evaluation Do not let the target leak into
features Clean

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:29.129
training data and test data consistently Report
limitations clearly
